<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>He brought me to His banqueting table...</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>He lifted me up into heavenly places...</l></lg>
<lg label="4."><l>My Beloved is mine and I am His...</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
